       CBL QUALIFY(EXTEND)
      * THE SAME PROGRAM AS ZE147N UNDER QUALIFY(EXTEND): A AND B NAME
      * EVERY LEVEL CONTAINING THE 02 C, A COMPLETE SET OF QUALIFIERS,
      * SO C OF A IS UNIQUE. ACCEPT.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE147P.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  A.
           02  B.
               03  C PIC X.
               03  A PIC X.
           02  C PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SPACE TO C OF A.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM ZE147P.
